sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Guest as Customer (Client)
    participant GW as API Gateway
    participant BOOK as Booking Service
    participant REDIS as Redis (Distributed Lock)
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant MQ as Message Queue

    Note over Guest, DB: Phase: The Locking Phase (Atomic Operation)

    Guest->>GW: Click "Book Now" (RoomTypeID, Dates)
    GW->>BOOK: Request Booking
    
    rect rgb(240, 240, 240)
        Note right of REDIS: Atomic Check-and-Decrement
        BOOK->>REDIS: DECR inventory:{RoomTypeID}:{Date}
        REDIS-->>BOOK: Current Count (after decrement)
    end

    alt if Count < 0
        Note over BOOK, REDIS: Race Condition Prevented
        BOOK->>REDIS: INCR inventory:{RoomTypeID}:{Date} (Rollback)
        BOOK-->>Guest: Error: Room Sold Out
    else if Count >= 0
        Note over BOOK, DB: Atomic Success
        BOOK->>DB: CREATE Booking (Status: PENDING_LOCK)
        DB-->>BOOK: BookingID, expiresAt
        
        BOOK->>MQ: Schedule Expiry Task (Delay: 15m)
        
        BOOK-->>Guest: Success: Proceed to Payment (15m remaining)
    end

    Note over Guest, MQ: Phase: Finalizing or Timeout

    alt Payment Success
        Guest->>BOOK: Payment Completed
        BOOK->>DB: UPDATE Booking (Status: CONFIRMED)
        BOOK-->>Guest: Booking Confirmed!
    else Payment Fails / Timeout (15m)
        MQ->>BOOK: Trigger HandleTimeout
        BOOK->>DB: UPDATE Booking (Status: EXPIRED)
        BOOK->>REDIS: INCR inventory:{RoomTypeID}:{Date} (Release Lock)
        Note right of REDIS: Room available for others
    end